//! id: kml
//! name: ⟪KML · 增益分级着色|KML · Gain-graded colors⟫
//! ext: kml
//zh 除文档名取 data.meta.title 外，与「导出 → 导出 KML（对地）」逐字节一致：文件夹层级为卫星 → 波束，等值线按增益渐变着色，Polygon 保留各自颜色。
//en Byte-identical to Export → Export KML (ground) apart from the document name (data.meta.title): satellite → beam folders, contours colored by level, polygons keep their colors.
//zh kml(data, 选项) 的可选项：
//en Options of kml(data, options):
//zh   name: '…'                       文档名
//en   name: '…'                       document name
//zh   colors: 'drawn'                 采用当前显示的电平配色（缺省 'gradient'，按增益渐变）
//en   colors: 'drawn'                 use the displayed level colors (default 'gradient')
//zh   lineWidth / fillOpacity / fill  线宽 / 填充不透明度（0–1）/ 填充开关
//en   lineWidth / fillOpacity / fill  line width / fill opacity 0–1 / fill on-off
//zh   contourName: (c, b) => …        等值线名称；peakName: (b) => … 波束中心名称
//en   contourName: (c, b) => …        contour name; peakName: (b) => … peak name

return file(`${data.meta.title}.kml`, kml(data, { name: data.meta.title }))
